<title>USA: Security Bank names Brummel chairman.</title>
<headline>Security Bank names Brummel chairman.</headline>
<dateline>COOS BAY, Ore. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Bank Holding Co said it named Chuck Brummel chairman of the board of directors. He will also remain chief executive officer and president of Security Bank and the holding company.</p>
<p>He succeeds Sam Dement, who becomes chairman of Pacific State Bank, which is merging with Security bank, but maintaining its own staff.</p>
